;Ireby Main Streamway

*begin Streamway

*export DingDongBellPitches.001

*export streamwayuptoduckresurvey.1
*export streamwayuptoduckresurvey.16
*export streamwayuptoduckresurvey.37

*export streamwaybubblestagdownstream.bubblestag

*Include Streamway1
*Include streamwayuptoduckresurvey
*Include streamwayupstreamofduckresurvey
*Include streamwaybubblestagdownstream
*Include dingdongbellpitches
*include bubblesroute

; pitch and entrance equates
*equate Bubbles.001 DingDongBellPitches.001			;Start of Bubbles Route
*equate Streamway1.022 DingDongBellPitches.022

; bubbles tag equates
*equate Bubbles.215 streamwaybubblestagdownstream.bubblestag 		;Bubbles Route Joins Streamway
*equate streamwaybubblestagdownstream.bubblestag  Streamway1.027


*equate	streamwayuptoduckresurvey.37       streamwayupstreamofduckresurvey.37x
*equate streamwayupstreamofduckresurvey.59 streamwaybubblestagdownstream.p59


*end Streamway

